{ The Greco attack is an attack that arises in the position of Giuoco Piano.
Press the space button to show you this attack }
1... exd4 { Capture de pawn } 2. cxd4 { Here black can simply withdraw his bishop. } 2... Bb4+ { This is the Greco attack.
Play Nc3 } 3. Nc3 d6 4. O-O { We have a clear advantage } *

